{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-the-community-motor-city","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"the-community-motor-city-aqua-dubai-motor-city","about":"The Community at Motor City is a residential development by Aqua Properties offering a collection of luxury studios, 1, 2 &amp; 3 bedroom apartments in a picturesque setting. A family-friendly oriented conceptualised development which allows users to discuss and interact with neighbours and live a pleasant lifestyle with more space.An epic development with cutting edge benefits of living in the amazing society crafted with intentions to offer more social space to the residents. The development offers a lifestyle for entrepreneurs, young and future generation. The premium class lifestyle that fosters a sense of community among residents to participate in growth and business.The project is not just about offering homes, but a wonderful space for work, life, and play. A co-working space for work and productivity, play areas for kids, make fun through activities &amp; interaction at numerous social spaces in the community. Overall the development ensures a wide range of appealing amenities and facilities for the residents to enjoy a luxury life.A high-end destination with epic finishes and grand interiors. These extraordinary homes are an epitome of luxury life to enjoy with family. You can experience world class lifestyle in the popular world of Motor City within Dubai. A strategic community that provides easy access to Dubai Autodrome, Dubai Sports City, Dubai Studio City, Palm Jumeirah, etc. in minutes.","price":1789888,"title":"The Community Motor city","bitrix":{"id":523,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"The Community Motor city","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Community Motor city","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Aqua Properties","project_location":"Motor City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h33